tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.05em; vertical-align: -0.128em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 1.23em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>9</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></span></span></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br/> Maximum value of <fmath class="fm-inline"><msup><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.05em; vertical-align: -0.128em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">[</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">]</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.05em; vertical-align: -0.128em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 1.23em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></fmath> is <fmath class="fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">∞</mi></fmath> .<br/>So, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style