;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></fmath> about origin in positive direction.<br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">→</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cos</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">s</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-separator">,</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">→</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.086em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow mtagname="msqrt"><mo class="fm-radic">√</mo><span style="vertical-align: 0.086em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-radicand" style="border-top-width: 0.072em;"><mn>2</mn></span></span></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">→</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">s</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cos</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-separator">,</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">→</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.086em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow mtagname="msqrt"><mo class="fm-radic">√</mo><span style="vertical-align: 0.086em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-radicand" style="border-top-width: 0.072em;"><mn>2</mn></span></span></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>So, equation <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>49</mn><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mn>25</mn><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>1225</mn></mrow></fmath> will transform into<br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>49</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><msup><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>25</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><msup><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>1225</mn></mrow></fmath><br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><mn>37</mn><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mn>37</mn><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>1225</mn></mrow></fmath><br/>On comparing with <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">q</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">x</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">r</mi><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">y</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow></fmath><br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-separator">,</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">q</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">−</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-separator">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">r</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-separator">,</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>1225</mn><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">.</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">q</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">r</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><msup><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>37</mn><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></fmath><br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><msup><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mn>35</mn><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>1225</mn></mrow></fmath><br/>So, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><msup><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">q</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">r</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow></fmath></div>
