nt="italic">a</mi><mo class="fm-separator">,</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">b</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">≡</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo class="fm-separator">,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></fmath></div>
