-menclose[notation=box]{border:thin solid}fmath none{display:none}</style><div class="text-primary border-bottom p-2 mb-2 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"></div><div style="position: relative;z-index:1"> The given situation is shown as<br/><div class="hscrollenable"><img src="static/media/wl_client/1/qdump/dd962b43da3e663bef2c213d7dbe3f88/8cd5460bd94c30f5bc50fb1d55de4203.png"/></div><br/>Let the angle be <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow></fmath> when the KE is <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></fmath> of total energy.<br/>Also, the moment of inertia of the bob of pendulum about the point of suspension<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">I</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">m</mi><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">l</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">⋅</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Also, velocity at that instant <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">l</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cos</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">⋅</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Now, according to the question,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">m</mi></mrow><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">v</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>75</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>100</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">I</mi></mrow><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>where, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.05em; vertical-align: -0.128em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">(</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">I</mi></mrow><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.05em; vertical-align: -0.128em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">)</mo></mrow></fmath> is the rotational KE of the particle,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">m</mi></mrow><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">v</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>75</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>100</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">m</mi><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">l</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mtext> [from Eq. (i)] </mtext></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">l</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">m</mi></mrow><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cos</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>3</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">m</mi><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">l</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath> [from Eq. (ii)<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><mrow><msup><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cos</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>3</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cos</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">±</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0.086em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow mtagname="msqrt"><mo class="fm-radic">√</mo><span style="vertical-align: 0.086em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-radicand" style="border-top-width: 0.072em;"><mn>3</mn></span></span></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">f</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>6</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath> (keeping only positive solution) <br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ω</mi></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></mrow></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mo class="fm-mo-Luc fm-prefix">(</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">∴</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></fmath> Time period, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">