ose[notation=left]{border-left:solid thin}fmath menclose[notation=box],menclose.fm-menclose[notation=box]{border:thin solid}fmath none{display:none}</style><div class="text-primary border-bottom p-2 mb-2 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"></div><div style="position: relative;z-index:1"> The given situation is shown below<br/><div class="hscrollenable"><img src="static/media/wl_client/1/qdump/dd962b43da3e663bef2c213d7dbe3f88/fe470e9384cf95234cf8e87faa72512a.png"/></div><br/>where, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>0</mn></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo></mrow></fmath> atmospheric pressure,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo></mrow></fmath> Air bubble of radius <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mn>1</mn><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">mm</mi></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-separator">,</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ρ</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo></mrow></mrow></fmath> density of liquid <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mn>2000</mn><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">kg</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∕</mo><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">m</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>3</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>and <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo></mrow></fmath> surface tension of liquid <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∕</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">m</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath> .<br/>Now, we know that, excess pressure inside an air bubble inside any liquid <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br/> Also, pressure inside the air bubble <fmath class="fm-inline"><mo>=</mo></fmath> pressure outside _ excess pressure<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">P</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mtext>inside</mtext></span></msub></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><span mtagname="munder" style="vertical-align: -0.533em;"><span class="fm-vert"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-underover-base"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">P</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>0</mn></span></msub></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-script fm-inline"><mtext>atmospheric pressure</mtext></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><span mtagname="munder" style="vertical-align: -0.426em;"><span class="fm-vert"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-underover-base"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">g</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">h</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-script fm-inline"><mtext>pressure due to liquid column</mtext></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><span mtagname="munder" style="vertical-align: -0.426em;"><span class="fm-vert"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-underover-base"><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-script fm-inline"><mtext>excess pressure inside air bubble</mtext></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Difference of pressure inside the air bubble and atmospheric pressure,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mtext>inside </mtext></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>0</mn></span></msub><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ρ</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">g</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">h</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2000</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>8</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>100</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></span></msup></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>1600</mn><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1800</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∕</mo><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">m</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/></div>
