ertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">C</mi></span></msub><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">α</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">c</mi></span></msub></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">L</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">S</mi></span></msub></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">L</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">C</mi></span></msub></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">α</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">C</mi></span></msub></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">α</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">S</mi></span></msub></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mro