nline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">W</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">J</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>From ideal gas equation,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">V</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">⋅</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">W</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">p</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">V</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mo>∴</mo></fmath> Eq. (i) becomes,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">W</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">∆</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">W</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>100</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">⋅</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Now, we know the relation for change in internal energy,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">U</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">C</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">V</mi></span></msub></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">U</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">γ</mi><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">.</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">.</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">.</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath> (iii) <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.05em; vertical-align: -0.128em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">(</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">∵</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">C</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">V</mi></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">γ</mi><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.05em; vertical-align: -0.128em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">)</mo></mrow></fmath> and since it is a monoatomic gas,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">∴</mo><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">γ</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>5</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>3</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>From Eqs. (ii) and (iii)<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">U</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>150</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">J</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">U</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.63em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>5</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>3</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>2</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>100</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>150</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">J</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Now, the heat given to the gas in the process is<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">Q</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">∆</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">U</mi><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">W</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">Q</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>250</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">J</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">Q</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>250</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">J</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath></div>
