<td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>28</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>1000</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">kg</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath> )<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mn>100</mn></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow mtagname="msqrt"><mo class="fm-radic" style="font-size: 2.256em; vertical-align: -0.219em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">√</mo><span style="vertical-align: 0.124em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-radicand" style="border-top-width: 0.148em;"><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mn>3000</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>28</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></span></span></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">⋅</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Now,<br/>for He, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><msubsup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">v</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">rms</mi></span><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mo>′</mo></span></msubsup></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow mtagname="msqrt"><mo class="fm-radic" style="font-size: 2.256em; vertical-align: -0.219em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">√</mo><span style="vertical-align: 0.124em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-radicand" style="border-top-width: 0.148em;"><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>(for He molar mass, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">M</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>100</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">kg</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath> )<br/>i.e <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><msubsup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">v</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">rms</mi></span><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mo>′</mo></span></msubsup></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow mtagname="msqrt"><mo class="fm-radic" style="font-size: 2.256em; vertical-align: -0.219em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">√</mo><span style="vertical-align: 0.124em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-radicand" style="border-top-width: 0.148em;"><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mn>3000</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">R</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">T</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></span></span></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">⋅</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Dividing Eq. (ii) by Eq. (i), we get<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0.252em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><msubsup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">v</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mtext>rms </mtext></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></span><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mo>′</mo></span></msubsup></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>100</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow mtagname="msqrt"><mo class="fm-radic" style="font-size: 4.482em; vertical-align: -0.262em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">√</mo><span style="vertical-align: 0.199em;"><span class