rea of loop, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">A</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><msup><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cm</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">π</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>4</mn></span></msup><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">m</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">I</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">A</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∆</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">t</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>0.2</mn><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;"> </mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">s</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mo>∴</mo></fmath> Magnetic field inside the solenoid <fmath class="fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">m</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">m</mi></span></msub></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">B</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">µ</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>0</mn></span></msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">I</mi></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">⋅</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">⋅</mo><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Magnetic flux linked with loop kept inside the solenoid normal to it,<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">φ</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">B</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">A</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">µ</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>0</mn></span></msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">I</mi></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">A</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath> [from Eq. (i)]<br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mo>∴</mo></fmath> According to Faraday's law of electromagnetic induction, magnitude of induced emf is given as<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">|</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">e</mi><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">|</mo></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">d</mi><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">φ</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style