fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">E</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∝</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">v</mi></mrow></fmath> or <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">E</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">∝</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">λ</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>where, <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">v</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo></mrow></fmath> frequency and <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">λ</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo></mrow></fmath> wavelength. </div>
