mathvariant="italic">ρ</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.252em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">Z</mi><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">M</mi></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">N</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">A</mi></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">a</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>3</mn></span></msup></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Since their is <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></fmath> Schottky defect, so the <fmath class="fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">Z</mi></fmath> value will change.<br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">Z</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>100</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>3.996</mn></mrow></fmath><br/>Putting this value of <fmath class="fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic" style="padding-right: 0.44ex;">Z</mi></fmath> in above equation<br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">ρ</mi><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mn>3.996</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mrow><mn>55.8</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">g</mi></mrow></mrow></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mn>6.023</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>23</mn></span></msup></mrow><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><msup><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo class="fm-infix" lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em">×</mo><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><msup><mn>10</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></span></msup><mspace style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".17em">‌</mspace><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cm</mi></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>3</mn></span></msup></mrow></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/><fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>5.8</mn><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">g</mi></mrow><msup><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">cm</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></span></msup></mrow><mo class="fm-postfix-tight">.</mo></mrow></mrow></fmath></div>
