="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">S</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>3</mn></span></msub></mrow></fmath> sol. </div>
