variant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></fmath> gas.<br/><div class="hscrollenable"><img src="static/media/wl_client/1/qdump/dd962b43da3e663bef2c213d7dbe3f88/fde096940f679eda7f21b53e8ab246b7.png"/></div><br/>Thermal decomposition of ammonium dichromate results into <fmath class="fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></fmath> production.<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">(</mo><msub><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">NH</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>4</mn></span></msub><mo class="fm-mo-Luc">)</mo></mrow><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub><msub><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">Cr</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">O</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>7</mn></span></msub></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">⟶</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">Cr</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">O</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>3</mn></span></msub></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">O</mi></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Treating aqueous solution of ammonium salt with nitrite results into <fmath class="fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></fmath> production.<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">NH</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>4</mn></span><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mo>+</mo></span></msubsup><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><msubsup><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">NO</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mo>−</mo></span></msubsup></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">⟶</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">O</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Reaction of ammonia with sodiumhypochlorite is a oxidation reduction reaction in which <fmath class="fm-inline"><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">NaOCl</mi></fmath> acts as oxidising agent and <fmath class="fm-inline"><msub><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">NH</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>3</mn></span></msub></fmath> acts as reducing agent. It does not results into <fmath class="fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></fmath> production.<br/> <fmath class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">NH</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>3</mn></span></msub></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">NaOCl</mi></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">⟶</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ma-repel-adj" mathvariant="normal">NaCl</mi><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">N</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>4</mn></span></msub></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix">+</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">O</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath></div>
