8em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">&gt;</mo><mrow><mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace><mtext> III </mtext></mrow><mspace style="margin-right: 0.28em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;" width=".28em">‌</mspace></mrow></mrow></fmath><br/>Therefore, reactivity towards esterification decreases in same order. </div>
